'''Snache''' (にょろ, ''Ni ~yoro'', '''Nyoro''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]] and [[Legend Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]].

