==Enemy==
The second enemy introduced, Snache is almost as harmless as a [[Doge]]. It has slightly more health and almost twice the attack power, but considering Doge deals 8 damage, this is barely an improvement. Like Doge and [[Those Guys]], it is used as a meatshield for stronger enemies of all sorts in almost all stages it appears in.

==Strategy==
Almost anything can kill a Snache. Be wary of the 120,000% Snaches in [[The Noble Tribe]], but treat them as a free source of money anywhere else.

In later encounters, the use of [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave Attackers]] like [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Gross]] is recommended to clear waves of Snaches, in aid of [[:Category:Single Attack Cats|Single Target Cats]] or others who may miss because of a Snache getting in the way, although this is far from necessary.

